; Inquiry-25.5 complete constitutive inheritance surface.
; This module closes the bounded three-point-shot claim over the actual
; carrier, participation, recognition, bridge, and R/A/P organization already
; formed by one encounter.  It adds no generator, selector, objective, or
; behavioral branch.

